# Contact form — Formsubmit.co (https://formsubmit.co)
#
# The contact form posts directly to https://formsubmit.co/ajax/varnofitness@gmail.com
# and uses Formsubmit's `_autoresponse` field to send a confirmation back to the
# customer. No access key, no env var, no signup.
#
# One-time setup after first deploy:
#   1. Submit the form once from the live site (https://mrugesh1989.github.io/varno-fitness-web/contact).
#   2. Formsubmit will email varnofitness@gmail.com a confirmation link — click it.
#   3. From that moment on, every submission delivers a tabular email to the gym
#      AND a confirmation email to the customer's address.
#
# If you ever want to hide varnofitness@gmail.com from the public bundle, replace
# the URL in src/components/ContactForm.tsx with the random Formsubmit hash they
# email after the verification step (e.g. https://formsubmit.co/ajax/abc123…).

# Optional: override the canonical site URL or sub-path used by the static
# export. Defaults to the GitHub Pages project URL; clear them when moving
# to the custom domain (see docs/HOSTING_AND_DNS.md, Part C).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://varnofitness.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH=
